ns false. Outside scope is not a compliance finding.","family":"scope","formalization":{"facts":[{"meaning":"The assessed entity is a licensed corporation addressed by the circular.","name":"is_lc","requires_judgment":false,"source_unit_ids":["d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u1.498"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The selected transaction is a US securities transaction subject to the shortened settlement cycle.","name":"us_short_cycle_transaction","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u0.0","d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u14.3336"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The selected transaction is a Canadian securities transaction subject to the shortened settlement cycle.","name":"canada_short_cycle_transaction","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u15.3399"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The LC has reviewed its liquidity risk management practices relevant to the selected transaction.","name":"liquidity_practices_reviewed","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u2.879","d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u3.996"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"},{"meaning":"The necessary funding is available to settle the selected transaction by its applicable settlement deadline, taking account of any cross-currency timing mismatch.","name":"timely_funding_available","requires_judgment":true,"source_unit_ids":["d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u3.996","d2ccfaeb3eb4b.u15.3399"],"type":"bool","unit":"Boolean"}],"result":"(and liquidity_practices_reviewed timely_funding_available)","result_type":"bool","scope":"(and is_lc us_short_cycle_transaction)"},"local_id":"l1","questions":["Does the broader readiness introduction require the same specific funding assurance for Canadian transactions despite the bullet's express US wording?"],"statement":"[TRUE_IS_COMPLIANT] For the selected transaction-level liquidity control, an LC handling a US transaction under the shortened cycle satisfies the proposed control when it has reviewed relevant liquidity practices and ensured